        "date": "2026-11-09T01:49:43Z"
      },
      "message": "feat(carry): fixtures read the carried stock; lathe carry refused by name; carried body cached\n\n- A carried setup's tagged fixtures are read against the body it is\n  entered with: a fixture standing inside material the earlier setups\n  left refuses the post by name (fixture_carried::FIXTURE_IN_CARRIED);\n  one seated on a face they machined is clear even where the declared\n  block still reaches through it. Live at the post gate.\n- The lathe / mill-turn part flip stays refused, now one named constant\n  (stock_sim::CARRY_MACHINE_REFUSAL), pinned on generation, the rest\n  chain, the sim and the post.\n- The carried body is memoized by content (origin stock, lattice, turns,\n  every cutting atom's exact moves), bounded, cleared with the document;\n  rest::carried_body_computes pins that an unrelated edit is a hit and an\n  upstream one recomputes.\n\nFixes #321\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
